{'symbol': 'TGT', 'date': '2021-03-11 06:30:00', 'title': 'TARGET CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, MARCH 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TARGET CORPORATION (NYSE:TGT) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 68 CENTS PER COMMON SHARE.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 10, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS MAY 19, 2021.'}